# Session logs. Deliberately not committed: this repo is public and
# run logs capture full tool-call traces, API responses, and agent
# narration, so a single unhandled traceback could put a credential
# in permanent git history. Logs go to the Week N Resources page in
# Notion instead. See Week 19 decision d(w19)-8.
runs/

